Contributors
============

Conductor is a natural-language workflow creator. Prose compiles into a
pipeline of typed verbs through a deterministic-first stack (NSDataDetector →
NLTagger → NLEmbedding → Foundation Models), and the pipeline runs under an
event-sourced runtime. See README.md for the full picture and CLAUDE.md for
coding conventions.

Architecture expectations for contributions:

  - Determinism first. Prefer a non-LLM path when one exists.
  - Every LLM output is @Generable. No prose-shaped returns.
  - Every LanguageModelSession is constructed per call and destroyed on
    return. No session state crosses calls.
  - Results cross verb boundaries only through the event log.
  - Every user-initiated action surfaces its status. No silent operations.

Attribution policy
------------------

When submitting commits or pull requests to this repository, remove all
AI-generated branding, attribution, and links. This includes but is not
limited to:

  - Co-Authored-By / Co-Created-By trailers referencing AI tools
  - Links to AI chat sessions (e.g. claude.ai, chatgpt.com)
  - "Generated by …" or "Assisted by …" footers

Reason: I simply do not want advertising in my repo.
